---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import Meeting from '../components/Meeting.astro';
import CampaignList from '../components/CampaignList.astro';
import { home, url } from '../lib/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="New Orleans streets for everyone" description={home.intro}>
  <section class="home-hero hero hero--split" data-enter aria-labelledby="hero-h">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><h1 id="hero-h">{home.title}</h1><p class="lead">{home.intro}</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn hero-action" href={url('/get-involved/')}>Take action <Arrow /></a><a class="text-link" href={url('/about/')}>Meet the coalition <Arrow /></a></div></div><div class="hero-photo" data-enter-media><img src={url(home.heroImage)} alt={home.heroAlt} width="1467" height="978" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /><div class="photo-note">More ways to move.<br />More room to belong.</div></div></div>
    <div class="wrap hero-foot"><span>Walking. Rolling. Biking. Transit. Driving.</span><a href={url('/complete-streets/')}>A better trip starts with a complete street <Arrow /></a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section definition-section" aria-labelledby="definition-title"><div class="wrap split-section"><figure class="definition-photo" data-moment="picture-develops" data-moment-opts='{"look":"film"}'><img src={url('/images/accessible-cycling.webp')} width="876" height="674" alt="A person riding an adaptive cycle." loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure><div class="section-copy"><h2 id="definition-title">{home.definitionTitle}</h2><p>{home.definition}</p><p>It connects these things into a trip that works—for people of every age and ability.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('/complete-streets/')}>What is a complete street? <Arrow /></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section policy-section" aria-labelledby="policy-title"><div class="wrap policy-grid"><h2 id="policy-title">{home.policyTitle}</h2><div><p class="large-copy">{home.policyIntro}</p><a class="text-link" href={url('/resources/policies/complete-streets-policy/')}>Understand the policy <Arrow /></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section report-section" aria-labelledby="report-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-top"><div><h2 id="report-title">How’s the city doing?</h2><p>Our 2025 report card puts the commitments next to the evidence.</p></div><a class="text-link" href={url('/resources/report-card-2025/')}>Read the report card <Arrow /></a></div><div class="grades" aria-label="2025 Complete Streets Report Card grades"><div><span class="grade">C−</span><h3>Walking & bicycling</h3></div><div><span class="grade">C+</span><h3>Transit</h3></div><div><span class="grade">B−</span><h3>Other complete streets priorities</h3></div></div><p class="report-note">2025 coalition assessment. Individual measures use different source years; see the report for details.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section campaigns-section" aria-labelledby="campaigns-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-top"><div><h2 id="campaigns-title">Change starts on a block.</h2><p>Meet the campaigns moving our work forward.</p></div><a class="text-link" href={url('/campaigns/')}>All campaigns <Arrow /></a></div><CampaignList photos limit={2} /></div></section>
  <section class="section community-section"><div class="wrap"><Meeting compact /></div></section>
  <section class="section invitation"><div class="wrap invitation-inner"><h2>{home.invitationTitle}</h2><div><p>{home.invitation}</p><a class="btn" href={url('/get-involved/')}>Get involved <Arrow /></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
